OL,3,GNEWSACity centre running club 'helped
OL,4,Ame find community'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who started running after a
OL,7,Fperiod of "being completely lost" said
OL,8,Fhe hoped his challenge to run to every
OL,9,Fstation on Greater Manchester's
OL,10,FMetrolink tram network would help raise
OL,11,Fawareness around mental health.
OL,13,FJamie Soutar said he found himself
OL,14,Ffeeling isolated after a break-up and
OL,15,Fselling his house.
OL,17,F"I'd lived in Manchester for 10 years
OL,18,Fbut I didn't know anybody. Big cities
OL,19,Fcan feel like that, and I'd convinced
OL,20,Fmyself my life wasn't worth much," the
OL,21,F36-year-old said.
